@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

### 2. Tao luot nop hop le - 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001"
}

### 3. Thieu studentCode - 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001"
}

### 4. Thieu repositoryUrl - 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001"
}

### 5. Assignment khong ton tai - 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001"
}

### 6. Doc submission theo id - thay GUID bang id tra ve o request 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 7. SignalR negotiate - 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 8. Sai duong dan hub - 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Root API
GET {{baseUrl}}/
